# bend-cad: completeness, for solve_complete (DESIGN §10.4 "C6 plan",
# C6d). Proofs only.
# Generated: python3 tools/expand.py tools/drafts/completepf.draft lib/completepf.bend
#
# At the level l whose first precision is P = P_l: the solver's plan at P
# is the blocks in turn (lib/pblkpf.bend's pb_ok) from the pins' box (the
# pins at the drawing's values, radius 0, which is x there); the whole
# verdict passes (the plan checker, the side conditions, the pins held);
# so the precision loop stops at P and the answer holds x.

